{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t發展局就紅磡站周邊及海濱一帶用地，提出修訂發展建議，包括於海旁興建兩幢地標式商住樓宇。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n發展局常任秘書長何珮玲在本台節目說，項目中的高層觀景平台將對外開放，是否免費會視乎財務可行性再作決定，她又強調項目不會阻擋獅子山景觀。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：梁家奇\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T12:01:19.126860+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T11:44:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T17:38:37.478100+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T11:58:40.389239+00:00","content_hash":"e1ff6bc5efe624cf18a99b8742875f01cda3c90b1bc70b51df736db1b7710169","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}